>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"line-height:120%\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">无论选择网申或内推，新城校招唯一报名渠道为【网申门户】，所有简历均需线上提交。</font></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:6.0000pt; margin-bottom:6.0000pt; text-align:left; margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">爱在吾悦，同新同行。</font></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">在新城，定义你的新程！</font></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:0pt 0pt 0.0001pt\"> </p>",
